"Am orchestrat un pipeline CI/CD folosind GitHub Actions pentru a automatiza "
"testarea, linting-ul și deployment-ul containerelor Docker pe AWS EC2."

#: templates/portfolio/home.html:216
msgid ""
"Integrated PostgreSQL for structured data storage and Cloudinary for "
"optimized media management, implementing reCAPTCHA v3 and a custom NLP "
"pipeline to filter spam emails."
